'''Appropriate Tools''' is an [[Combat Achievements/Elite|elite combat achievement]] which requires the player to defeat the [[Pestilent Bloat]] in the [[Theatre of Blood/Entry Mode|Theatre of Blood: Entry Mode]] with everyone having a [[salve amulet]] equipped.

This achievement can be completed with any version of the salve amulet.

